{"sha": "96f0b2c984ee9606d1e259d6c94d6199e8d8352df04e46e66f412d0979b92ffd", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:8}", "设 $A = \\sum a_n$（绝对收敛），$B_m = \\sum_{k\\leq m} b_k \\to B$，", "且以 $M$ 为界。则", "\\[", "C_N = \\sum_{k=0}^{N} c_k = \\sum_{n=0}^{N} a_n B_{N-n}", "\\]", "（按 $a$ 的下标合并）。写作", "\\[", "C_N - AB = \\sum_{n=0}^{N} a_n (B_{N-n} - B) - B\\sum_{n > N} a_n .", "\\]", "末项趋于 $0$。将和式在 $n = \\lfloor N/2", "\\rfloor$ 处分段：对 $n \\leq N/2$，有 $N - n \\geq N/2$，故 $\\abs{B_{N-n} - B}", "\\leq \\varepsilon_N := \\sup_{m \\geq N/2}\\abs{B_m - B} \\to 0$，且", "此部分 $\\leq \\varepsilon_N \\sum\\abs{a_n}$；对 $n > N/2$，", "$\\abs{B_{N-n} - B} \\leq 2M$，而此部分 $\\leq 2M \\sum_{n >", "N/2} \\abs{a_n} \\to 0$。因此 $C_N \\to AB$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:9}", "取 $u_n = 2^{-n} e_n$（$e_n$ 为仅有一个", "$1$ 位于第 $n$ 个位置、其余为零的数列）。则 $\\sum \\norm{u_n}_\\infty = \\sum 2^{-n} <", "\\infty$：绝对收敛。但部分和 $S_N =", "(1, \\tfrac12, \\dots, 2^{-N}, 0, \\dots)$ 必须收敛到", "数列 $(2^{-n})_n$，而它\\emph{并非}最终为零：", "其极限在 $E$ 之外。在 $E$ 之内，$(S_N)$ 为柯西列而无极限（$\\norm{S_N", "- x}_\\infty \\geq 2^{-N-1}$ 未能排除任何最终为零的 $x$：", "对任一 $x \\in E$，若其在第 $K$ 项之后全为零，则 $\\norm{S_N - x} \\geq", "2^{-K-1}$，当 $N > K$）。故该级数在 $E$ 中不收敛。", "完备性恰是 \\cref{thm:b2:nvs:absoluteconvergence}", "所需要的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:10}", "两者 $\\arctan(n+1) - \\arctan n$ 与", "$\\arctan\\frac{1}{n^2+n+1}$ 均属于 $\\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$，", "由正切加法公式可得", "\\[", "\\tan\\bigl(\\arctan(n{+}1) - \\arctan n\\bigr)", "= \\frac{(n+1) - n}{1 + n(n+1)} = \\frac{1}{n^2 + n + 1} :", "\\]", "两者正切值相等，而 $\\tan$ 在该区间上为单射，故", "该式成立。由裂项相消，", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\arctan\\frac{1}{n^2+n+1}", "= \\arctan(N{+}1) - \\arctan 1 \\xrightarrow[N\\to\\infty]{}", "\\frac\\pi2 - \\frac\\pi4 = \\frac\\pi4 .", "\\]", "", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:11}", "其一：$\\sqrt{n+1} - \\sqrt n = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n+1} + \\sqrt n}", "\\sim \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt n}$，故通项 $\\sim", "2^{-\\alpha}n^{-\\alpha/2}$：收敛当且仅当 $\\frac\\alpha2 > 1$，", "即 $\\alpha > 2$。其二：$1 - \\cos\\frac1n \\sim", "\\frac{1}{2n^2}$：收敛。其三：$\\bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\bigr)^n =", "\\eu^{\\,n\\ln(1 + 1/n)} = \\eu^{\\,1 - \\frac1{2n} + O(n^{-2})} =", "\\eu\\bigl(1 - \\frac{1}{2n} + O(n^{-2})\\bigr)$，于是", "\\[", "\\eu - \\Bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\Bigr)^{\\!n} \\sim \\frac{\\eu}{2n} :", "\\]", "正项且与调和级数的某倍数等价，故发散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:12}", "由单调性，$n\\,a_{2n} \\leq a_{n+1} + a_{n+2} + \\dots +", "a_{2n} = S_{2n} - S_n \\to 0$（由收敛级数的", "柯西准则）。于是 $2n\\,a_{2n} \\to 0$，且 $(2n{+}1)\\,", "a_{2n+1} \\leq (2n{+}1)a_{2n} = \\frac{2n+1}{2n}\\,(2n\\,a_{2n}) \\to", "0$：$(na_n)$ 的两个子列均趋于 $0$，故 $na_n \\to 0$。", "", "\\emph{逆命题不成立：}$a_n = \\frac1{n\\ln n}$ 为正的递减数列，", "$na_n = \\frac1{\\ln n} \\to 0$，而 $\\sum a_n$", "发散（伯特兰分界，见 \\cref{pb:b2:series:1}，", "第 18 题）。\\emph{单调性必不可少：}令 $a_n = \\frac1n$，若 $n$", "为 $2$ 的幂，否则 $a_n = 2^{-n}$：$\\sum a_n \\leq", "\\sum_k 2^{-k} + \\sum_n 2^{-n} < \\infty$，但 $na_n = 1$", "在 $2$ 的各次幂上，故 $na_n \\not\\to 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:series:1}", "\\textbf{1.}对 $m$ 用归纳法：$m = 0$ 时两边均为 $1$；", "归纳步乘以 $\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta$，并用到", "加法公式 $\\cos(m\\theta + \\theta) =", "\\cos m\\theta\\cos\\theta - \\sin m\\theta\\sin\\theta$，$\\sin(m\\theta", "+ \\theta) = \\sin m\\theta\\cos\\theta + \\cos m\\theta\\sin\\theta$。", "改用二项式定理展开，取 $m = 2n+1$，", "并合并虚部（即 $\\iu\\sin\\theta$ 的奇次幂，", "其中 $\\iu^{2j+1} = (-1)^j\\iu$）：", "\\[", "\\sin\\bigl((2n{+}1)\\theta\\bigr) = \\sum_{j=0}^{n}(-1)^j", "\\binom{2n+1}{2j+1}\\cos^{2(n-j)}\\theta\\,\\sin^{2j+1}\\theta .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{2.}在 $\\intoo0{\\frac\\pi2}$ 上 $\\sin\\theta \\neq 0$，于是各项提出", "$\\sin^{2n+1}\\theta$，余下", "$\\bigl(\\frac{\\cos^2\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta}\\bigr)^{n-j} =", "(\\cot^2\\theta)^{n-j}$：即上式，其中 $P_n(x) =", "\\sum_j(-1)^j\\binom{2n+1}{2j+1}x^{n-j}$。其 $n$ 次项", "系数为 $j = 0$ 时的 $\\binom{2n+1}{1} = 2n + 1 \\neq 0$。", "", "\\textbf{3.}当 $\\theta_k = \\frac{k\\pi}{2n+1}$ 时：", "$\\sin\\bigl((2n{+}1)\\theta_k\\bigr) = \\sin k\\pi = 0$，而", "$\\sin^{2n+1}\\theta_k \\neq 0$，故 $P_n(\\cot^2\\theta_k) = 0$。", "$\\theta_k$ 在 $\\intoo0{\\frac\\pi2}$ 中严格递增，而该区间上", "$\\cot^2$ 严格递减，故数值 $x_k =", "\\cot^2\\theta_k$ 两两不同 --- $n$ 个互异的", "根，是 $n$ 次多项式的全部根。", "", "\\textbf{4.}由韦达定理，根之和等于", "$x^{n-1}$ 项与 $x^n$ 项系数之比的相反数：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\cot^2\\theta_k =", "\\frac{\\binom{2n+1}{3}}{\\binom{2n+1}{1}}", "= \\frac{(2n+1)(2n)(2n-1)/6}{2n+1} = \\frac{n(2n-1)}{3}.", "\\]", ""]}